module Core

### Represents a type-erased boxed value with runtime type metadata.
### `Data` is the standard escape hatch for APIs that need to transport
### arbitrary values when the static type is not known or cannot be expressed in
### the public surface.
record Data
  ### Stores the runtime type identifier of the boxed payload.
  secret type_id: U64
  ### Stores the heap address of the boxed payload.
  secret data_address: Address
  ### Stores the size in bytes of the boxed payload.
  secret data_size: ByteSize
